</pre></td></tr></tbody></table></code></pre></div></div>

<p>Just pass the corresponding category string. If it returns <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">NO</code>, you can check the cause via <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">NSError</code>’s <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">error.localizedDescription</code>.</p>

<p>You can use:</p>

