<h3 id="category-options">Category Options</h3>

<p>The seven categories above can be thought of as seven main scenarios, but these seven certainly can’t satisfy all developer needs. <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">CoreAudio</code>’s approach is: <strong>first pick one of the seven as the baseline, then fine-tune. <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">CoreAudio</code> provides a few options for each <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">Category</code> to do the fine-tuning.</strong></p>

